  "id": "field-rates",
  "title": "A field's whole life in one query",
  "takeaway": "Oil peaked at 277 thousand Sm³ a month in December 2008. Gas came with it, about 147 Sm³ of gas for every Sm³ of oil. From June 2010 the field produced more water than oil every month until production stopped in 2016.",
